# --- Operator addition, 2026-09-12: "hauptstädte und wichtige städte,
# prag, brünn, münchen, frankfurt, köln, paris, usw." -- Natural Earth's
# 1:110m scale keeps only one city per mid-sized country (the capital)
# plus the world's biggest megacities, so DACH-region secondary hubs
# that matter for VHF/UHF tropo DX from JN67VV are missing even though
# several outrank countries' own capitals already in this file.
# Coordinates: two independent web lookups per city, agreed within
# ~0.15 deg (see Contestprogramm session notes). Population: the
# official "Metropolregion" (EU metropolitan-region) figure where an
# authority publishes one directly, for the same order-of-magnitude
# scale drawCitiesLayer()'s >=1,000,000 marker-size threshold already
# assumes -- not a strict single definition, since the source cities
# above aren't consistently one definition either.
